  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RLF - Ukrnafta II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A sovereign guaranteed loan of up to EUR 160 million to the &quot;PJSC Ukrnafta&quot;  (the &quot;Company&quot; or &quot;Ukrnafta&quot;), to finance its emergency capex.  The Loan will finance the construction and installation of c.250 MW of  peaking distributed gas-fired co-generation capacity (the &quot;Project&quot;).  In the current crisis environment triggered by the war on Ukraine, the project  will address the electricity and heat deficit and ensure uninterrupted energy  supply to the population and businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
